WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.540
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.490 --> 00:21.480
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.120 --> 00:29.960
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.750 --> 00:38.260
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.470 --> 00:47.470
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.770 --> 00:55.530
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.610 --> 01:00.870
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.290 --> 01:09.290
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.810 --> 01:11.800
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.800 --> 01:16.010
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.470
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.470 --> 01:22.720
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.720 --> 01:29.190
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.190 --> 01:31.020
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:51.410 --> 01:52.400
<i>A face...</i>

01:53.480 --> 01:56.750
<i>It's a human face</i>
<i>that's just been skinned off.</i>

02:09.000 --> 02:13.400
<i>The woman who ate mermaid flesh and</i>
<i>abducted Nanao when he was a baby.</i>

02:14.400 --> 02:16.810
<i>The woman who's raising Nanao...</i>

02:16.810 --> 02:19.400
<i>and giving him the medicine</i>
<i>that heals his wounds.</i>

02:21.610 --> 02:23.740
Nanao, run away.

02:24.350 --> 02:29.780
She's a dreadful woman.
Nanao.

02:30.990 --> 02:32.850
What are you doing, Mana?

02:36.130 --> 02:37.620
Mana!

02:52.440 --> 02:56.940
Episode 9
The Last Face
(Part II)

03:06.460 --> 03:07.680
Mana!

03:08.560 --> 03:10.960
Don't come here, Nanao!
Run!

03:22.670 --> 03:23.760
Go!

03:26.740 --> 03:27.870
Mana!

03:30.850 --> 03:31.970
I'm OK.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.120
Mana.

03:53.040 --> 03:55.570
You hide here.

03:55.570 --> 03:57.770
I'll go get the medicine
my mom gave me.

03:57.770 --> 03:59.710
It's in my room.

04:00.610 --> 04:02.800
I don't need such things, I'll...

04:02.910 --> 04:03.940
Stay there!

04:04.210 --> 04:05.150
Nanao!

04:05.550 --> 04:08.410
<i>That medicine heals any wounds.</i>

04:12.790 --> 04:14.780
<i>The face in the storehouse...</i>

04:15.890 --> 04:17.720
<i>A mask of a human face.</i>

04:18.490 --> 04:20.790
<i>I have to tell Yuta.</i>

05:18.250 --> 05:22.160
<i>The woman who ate mermaid</i>
<i>flesh and abducted the baby.</i>

05:23.290 --> 05:25.490
<i>The woman who's raising Nanao...</i>

05:25.490 --> 05:27.790
<i>giving him the medicine</i>
<i>that heals wounds.</i>

05:29.200 --> 05:31.530
<i>Their faces are completely different.</i>

05:32.000 --> 05:34.870
<i>But what if they're the same woman?</i>

05:39.410 --> 05:40.500
There it is.

05:40.980 --> 05:43.040
If she takes this, her wound will...

05:48.480 --> 05:49.680
Nanao.

05:50.720 --> 05:52.120
Mom!

05:52.720 --> 05:53.880
Nanao!

05:55.790 --> 05:57.790
Mom, we're in trouble!

05:57.790 --> 05:59.490
A strange woman hurt Mana, and...

06:00.630 --> 06:02.030
What's this?

06:02.800 --> 06:04.160
There's blood on your neck.

06:04.670 --> 06:06.370
Are you hurt too, Mom?!

06:06.370 --> 06:07.860
It's all right.

06:08.100 --> 06:11.070
You're all right now, Nanao.

06:12.210 --> 06:13.570
Where's Mana?

06:13.940 --> 06:16.340
I'll go see if she's OK.

06:17.250 --> 06:19.510
In the bush, in the yard.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.580
But that woman's still out there!

06:22.820 --> 06:27.310
It's all right.
You stay here and don't move.

06:27.420 --> 06:28.390
OK?

06:30.930 --> 06:33.090
Stay right there, Nanao!

06:35.730 --> 06:39.500
Nanao.
She's a dreadful woman.

06:41.270 --> 06:44.430
Nanao, run away!

06:52.480 --> 06:54.070
You're still alive.

06:58.750 --> 07:02.020
What's that face
in the storehouse?

07:02.720 --> 07:05.520
So you did see it.

07:09.870 --> 07:11.230
What are you doing?

07:11.730 --> 07:12.700
Stop it!

07:13.400 --> 07:14.460
Let go of me!

07:15.500 --> 07:16.370
Mana!

07:17.570 --> 07:18.660
Yuta!

07:19.210 --> 07:21.200
What are you doing to Mana?!

07:21.640 --> 07:23.940
You two are still alive?!

07:24.410 --> 07:25.440
Yuta!

07:36.220 --> 07:37.460
<i>The wounds have healed!</i>

07:37.460 --> 07:38.550
<i>This woman...</i>

07:50.040 --> 07:54.670
<i>Mom.</i>
<i>That woman might still be outside.</i>

07:56.610 --> 07:59.270
<i>But I'm going to help her!</i>

08:03.520 --> 08:04.420
Nanao.

08:05.790 --> 08:06.810
Grandma.

08:07.860 --> 08:09.590
Give me the medicine.

08:09.660 --> 08:11.990
No!
I have to give it to Mana!

08:12.160 --> 08:12.590
-Give it here, Nanao.

08:12.590 --> 08:13.330
-Give it here, Nanao.
-No!

08:13.330 --> 08:13.920
-Give it here, Nanao.

08:27.480 --> 08:31.910
Look, Nanao, this is the medicine
you've been taking.

08:32.780 --> 08:34.770
This is your mother's medicine.

08:35.020 --> 08:38.140
But nothing happened to me.

08:38.390 --> 08:41.720
Besides, Mom wouldn't make me
take such a medicine!

08:42.020 --> 08:44.580
She's not your mother!

08:45.090 --> 08:47.060
What are you talking about, Grandma?!

08:47.530 --> 08:49.090
Run away, Nanao!

08:49.330 --> 08:51.630
She's a dreadful woman!

08:52.030 --> 08:52.860
So!

08:53.200 --> 08:54.460
That's not true!

08:54.570 --> 08:55.700
Nanao!

08:57.670 --> 09:02.080
You also ate mermaid flesh,
didn't you?

09:03.180 --> 09:04.270
And you?

09:05.250 --> 09:08.240
I've been alive for 500 years.

09:09.620 --> 09:10.810
500 years...

09:29.040 --> 09:39.010
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

09:42.880 --> 09:44.040
<i>This scar.</i>

09:45.790 --> 09:47.050
<i>It's that woman's.</i>

09:49.290 --> 09:51.760
You switched faces.

09:59.130 --> 10:02.040
Weren't you left with a scar?

10:03.000 --> 10:04.530
Wasn't it painful for you?

10:07.910 --> 10:11.650
Twenty five years ago,
I was about to lose Nanao...

10:11.650 --> 10:14.770
lying right there,
to his father's side of the family.

10:15.820 --> 10:17.050
Mother?

10:20.260 --> 10:23.880
Nanao was my life.

10:31.600 --> 10:36.000
<i>Mom, I'm going to go</i>
<i>and live with Dad.</i>

10:40.040 --> 10:41.130
<i>Why?</i>

10:42.180 --> 10:44.650
<i>Because you scare me.</i>

10:45.310 --> 10:47.180
<i>You take me to and from school.</i>

10:47.480 --> 10:49.640
<i>You don't let me play</i>
<i>with my friends.</i>

10:49.990 --> 10:53.550
<i>So I'm going to go live with Dad.</i>

11:09.070 --> 11:10.500
<i>Mermaid flesh.</i>

11:13.140 --> 11:16.080
<i>Nanao, this is a medicine...</i>

11:16.080 --> 11:19.840
handed down through the generations,
that heals any illness.

11:20.950 --> 11:24.390
<i>Before you leave,</i>
<i>I want you to eat it.</i>

11:25.890 --> 11:27.680
<i>I'll eat with you.</i>

11:35.200 --> 11:39.430
<i>Now, Nanao, it's your turn.</i>

11:44.910 --> 11:46.340
<i>My throat is burning!</i>

11:47.210 --> 11:48.540
<i>Eat it!</i>

11:48.680 --> 11:51.650
<i>No, Mom!</i>
<i>I don't want to!</i>

11:53.280 --> 11:54.710
<i>Eat it, Nanao!</i>

12:01.060 --> 12:03.890
<i>Nanao, stay with me!</i>
<i>It's your grandma!</i>

12:03.990 --> 12:06.460
<i>Your mother poisoned you,</i>
<i>didn't she, Nanao!</i>

12:07.630 --> 12:11.430
<i>Mom, help me...Mom...</i>

12:11.770 --> 12:14.330
<i>Please, take good care of Nanao.</i>

12:14.500 --> 12:15.260
<i>Yes.</i>

12:18.740 --> 12:19.640
<i>Go.</i>

12:22.610 --> 12:26.880
<i>Nanao...</i>
<i>Nanao, I promise...</i>

12:28.020 --> 12:30.880
<i>I'll come and get you.</i>

12:37.990 --> 12:42.520
And because of the
mermaid poison, I...

12:44.300 --> 12:47.000
My life turned into hell after that.

12:47.540 --> 12:50.970
Rumors spread.
I couldn't even go outside.

12:51.540 --> 12:54.270
On top of that,
the scar on my face hurt...

12:54.710 --> 12:57.270
the pain grew worse and worse
as time went by.

12:57.850 --> 13:02.980
But, even though I wanted to die,
any other wound would heal instantly.

13:02.980 --> 13:04.980
I didn't age at all.

13:05.550 --> 13:09.650
I had no choice but to live on
with this disfigured face.

13:12.190 --> 13:14.180
Nanao, did you know?

13:14.860 --> 13:17.590
I used to come watch you
from afar once in a while.

13:20.240 --> 13:22.600
Every time I saw you,
you had grown.

13:23.640 --> 13:24.830
High school.

13:25.840 --> 13:26.930
College.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.840
You became a grown man.

13:30.910 --> 13:32.940
And he was born.

13:34.380 --> 13:35.870
Such an adorable child.

13:38.220 --> 13:41.350
It was as if you had come back to me.

13:41.560 --> 13:43.790
Mother, he's not me!

13:44.660 --> 13:48.890
It was after I took him
that I found this face.

13:50.370 --> 13:53.890
A dead body that
had washed ashore.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.600
Once I switched faces.

14:01.210 --> 14:03.470
I felt so much better.

14:06.710 --> 14:07.980
Mom!

14:08.720 --> 14:09.740
Nanao!

14:09.950 --> 14:10.920
Nanao!

14:12.520 --> 14:14.750
Nanao, come to me!

14:15.120 --> 14:16.020
Nanao.

14:16.460 --> 14:21.090
I'm your father!
I came to save you!

14:22.630 --> 14:24.330
Nanao, come here.

14:24.600 --> 14:25.620
Mom!

14:26.670 --> 14:28.860
Don't go, Nanao!
She's...

14:35.580 --> 14:36.600
Yuta?

14:37.780 --> 14:42.380
It's all right, Nanao.
He told me he can't die.

14:43.990 --> 14:44.850
Wait.

14:45.550 --> 14:46.990
What are you doing to Nanao?

14:54.060 --> 14:57.520
I was going to wait until
you grew up a little more, but...

14:59.600 --> 15:01.330
Is she going to feed him
mermaid flesh?!

15:02.670 --> 15:05.430
She keeps the mermaid flesh here?

15:06.170 --> 15:10.770
If I don't do something,
then Nanao will age and eventually die.

15:12.110 --> 15:15.910
But if he eats mermaid flesh,
we can live on together.

15:16.550 --> 15:20.950
Don't! You know that
mermaid flesh is a poison!

15:21.420 --> 15:24.930
He'll be all right. I've been
getting his body accustomed...

15:24.930 --> 15:28.660
to mermaid flesh little by little
by giving it to him in powdered form.

15:31.270 --> 15:33.600
You!
I won't let you do it!

15:35.140 --> 15:38.000
Open up! Don't be stupid!

15:39.470 --> 15:44.100
Only one in a few hundred can
become a perfect immortal!

15:44.580 --> 15:46.010
Don't you understand?!

15:47.680 --> 15:50.210
Open up!
Don't be stupid!

15:50.390 --> 15:52.350
This is enough!

15:52.650 --> 15:56.320
I apologize if I made you become
the person you are now.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.650
He's not Nanao!

16:00.360 --> 16:01.920
What are you talking about?

16:02.560 --> 16:07.970
Nanao's back.
He came back to me.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.470
Mom.

16:11.140 --> 16:15.580
We'll continue to be together,
forever.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.640
What are you looking for?

16:21.280 --> 16:22.650
Mermaid flesh?

16:31.230 --> 16:35.220
Nanao, run! Nanao!

16:35.530 --> 16:37.760
Nanao! Nanao!

16:40.440 --> 16:41.370
Nanao.

16:42.140 --> 16:43.360
Give it here!

16:43.540 --> 16:46.410
Incredible.
You're already healing.

16:47.610 --> 16:48.440
Mana!

17:01.990 --> 17:02.920
This...

17:04.490 --> 17:06.690
It's a bad woman's face.

17:08.530 --> 17:09.460
Nanao.

17:10.830 --> 17:11.630
No!

17:11.770 --> 17:12.790
Don't do it!

17:14.070 --> 17:15.000
Nanao.

17:17.640 --> 17:19.000
What do you want to do?

17:19.370 --> 17:21.000
Will you eat it for me?

17:22.380 --> 17:25.370
Are you really my mom?

17:26.210 --> 17:27.270
Yes.

17:29.080 --> 17:31.880
I also ate it.

17:33.420 --> 17:34.980
It's not poisonous at all.

17:48.840 --> 17:50.170
Why?!

17:52.170 --> 17:55.510
Am I going to have
this scar as long as I live?

17:57.050 --> 18:00.950
Do I have to go on for
hundreds of years with this scar?

18:00.950 --> 18:06.780
Replacing my face every time
the pain comes back?

18:12.790 --> 18:13.820
Mom.

18:17.870 --> 18:19.530
I'm here for you.

18:28.640 --> 18:29.470
I'll eat it.

18:29.910 --> 18:30.780
Nanao.

18:32.480 --> 18:35.040
You said I'd be OK.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.050
Nanao!

18:36.180 --> 18:37.310
No!

18:41.760 --> 18:43.220
It may be poisonous.

18:44.330 --> 18:45.380
<i>Eat it!</i>

18:45.790 --> 18:48.820
<i>No, Mom!</i>
<i>I don't want to!</i>

18:55.900 --> 18:58.130
<i>What if it doesn't work</i>
<i>this time either?</i>

19:01.140 --> 19:01.940
<i>But...</i>

19:04.380 --> 19:05.440
Damn it!

19:07.150 --> 19:08.050
Don't eat it!

19:23.460 --> 19:25.930
It's a hundred years
too early for you.

19:27.340 --> 19:30.830
You're the one
who should've stopped him.

19:32.610 --> 19:37.370
I'm not so strong.

20:13.510 --> 20:14.450
Here...

20:15.820 --> 20:17.050
I'm giving this back.

20:18.590 --> 20:19.950
And him, too.

20:21.560 --> 20:23.080
Mother.

20:29.960 --> 20:30.900
Mom.

20:32.170 --> 20:37.160
Nanao,
I'm going away for a while.

20:46.850 --> 20:48.580
Mom!

20:50.050 --> 20:52.710
Yuta, she's...

21:15.120 --> 21:23.640
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

21:25.010 --> 21:33.520
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

21:35.000 --> 21:43.860
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

21:44.900 --> 21:54.410
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

21:59.490 --> 22:08.510
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

22:09.470 --> 22:17.980
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

22:19.100 --> 22:28.610
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

22:28.950 --> 22:38.480
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

22:43.420 --> 22:52.930
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

22:56.310 --> 22:58.410
Did you hear about the fire
that burned down the storehouse?

22:58.410 --> 23:00.450
Yeah, I heard the cause
is still unknown.

23:00.450 --> 23:02.180
They say someone died in it.

23:02.180 --> 23:03.620
A woman.

23:09.560 --> 23:12.290
So your mom hasn't come back yet.

23:12.490 --> 23:13.220
No.

23:14.200 --> 23:18.000
So now I have to go live
with that man after all.

23:20.230 --> 23:24.690
I wonder where my mom went.

23:29.280 --> 23:31.950
Well, I guess it's only
natural you miss her.

23:31.950 --> 23:33.640
Yeah, you're still a kid.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.120
What do you mean?!

23:36.120 --> 23:38.550
I measured my height yesterday,
and I was taller!

23:38.650 --> 23:40.790
You were.
So you're growing as you should.

23:40.790 --> 23:43.550
Hey, can I see you again?

23:43.660 --> 23:44.780
I don't know.

23:45.260 --> 23:48.960
We might not recognize you
when you're grown up.

23:48.960 --> 23:51.360
So you holler at us, OK?

23:52.570 --> 23:56.660
Bye, Yuta, Mana!

23:57.610 --> 23:58.800
See ya!

23:58.940 --> 24:00.410
Take care!

24:05.910 --> 24:07.880
This place has changed completely.

24:07.880 --> 24:10.540
The only thing that remains
unchanged is the loud birds.

24:11.020 --> 24:14.090
After visiting the grave of a woman
who had been kind to me long ago...

24:14.090 --> 24:16.420
I ran into Sokichi after 60 years.

24:16.920 --> 24:18.360
Nae is still alive?!

24:18.690 --> 24:20.560
She's living in the house
of her former fiancé Eijiro...

24:20.560 --> 24:23.720
and she still looks young like she did
back then? She hasn't aged at all?

24:24.300 --> 24:25.460
What does that mean?

24:25.730 --> 24:30.000
Was the legend of the mermaid ash
she told me true?

24:30.240 --> 24:30.990
Next, Episode 10,
Promised Tomorrow, Part I.

24:30.990 --> 24:34.410
Episode 10
Promised Tomorrow
(Part I)
Next, Episode 10,
Promised Tomorrow, Part I.

24:34.410 --> 24:34.980
